{
  "metadata": {
    "title": "Install PostgreSQL on MacOS (Apple Silicon m1/m2)",
    "slug": "install-postgresql-macos-apple-silicon-m1",
    "date": "2022-11-14",
    "updates": [],
    "category": "database",
    "category_list": ["database", "macos", "homebrew"],
    "tags": ["postgresql", "macos", "database", "homebrew", "brew"]
  },
  "base": {
    "anonce": "What is Homebrew, why is it needed and how to install it for systems: macOS (Apple Silicon) and Windows.",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "h2",
        "text": "Introduction",
        "id": "Introduction"
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "text": "When developing applications, you often need to store and manage data in databases. This article shows how to install PostgreSQL on macOS and connect it to your applications."
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "text": "We will cover installation methods, terminal usage, connecting from apps, and basic PostgreSQL commands."
      },

      {
        "type": "h2",
        "text": "Installation",
        "id": "Installation"
      },
      { "type": "p", "text": "You can install PostgreSQL in two ways:" },
      {
        "type": "ul",
        "items": [
          "Through the installer from the official site",
          "Using the Homebrew package manager (recommended)"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "text": "Both methods allow you to fully install PostgreSQL on your system."
      },
      {
        "type": "note",
        "kind": "info",
        "title": "Recommended way",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "p",
            "text": "The most common and recommended way to install PostgreSQL is via Homebrew."
          }
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "h3",
        "text": "Through the installer",
        "id": "Through-the-installer"
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "html": "Go to the <a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/ftp/source/\" target=\"_blank\">official PostgreSQL website</a> and download the version you need."
      },
      {
        "type": "ul",
        "items": [
          "Select required version (e.g., v14.2) and open the directory",
          "Download <strong>postgresql-[version].tar.gz</strong>",
          "Unzip and open the folder",
          "Check the INSTALL file for step-by-step instructions",
          "Follow instructions in terminal to install"
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "h3",
        "text": "Through Homebrew",
        "id": "Through-Homebrew"
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "text": "Before installing, check and update Homebrew:"
      },
      {
        "type": "ul",
        "items": [
          "Update: `brew update`",
          "Upgrade: `brew upgrade`",
          "Fix issues: `brew doctor`"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "note",
        "kind": "info",
        "title": "More info",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "p",
            "html": "See guide: <a href=\"https://amaryfilo.com/blog/how-install-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">How to Install Homebrew</a>."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "text": "Steps to install PostgreSQL with Homebrew:"
      },
      {
        "type": "ul",
        "items": [
          "`brew install postgresql`",
          "`brew services start postgresql` (start service)",
          "`brew services stop postgresql` (stop service)",
          "`brew services list` (check service status)",
          "Login: `psql postgres`",
          "List users: `\\du`",
          "Exit: `\\q`"
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "h3",
        "text": "Extras",
        "id": "Extras"
      },
      {
        "type": "ul",
        "items": [
          "Manual start: `/opt/homebrew/opt/postgresql/bin/postgres -D /opt/homebrew/var/postgres`",
          "Start/stop with pg_ctl: `pg_ctl -D /opt/homebrew/var/postgres start|stop`"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "note",
        "kind": "info",
        "title": "Uninstall",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "p",
            "text": "Remove PostgreSQL with: `brew uninstall postgresql`, then `brew cleanup` and `brew doctor`."
          }
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "h2",
        "text": "Errors",
        "id": "Errors"
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "text": "Common errors you may encounter during setup."
      },
      {
        "type": "note",
        "kind": "info",
        "title": "Tip",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "p",
            "text": "Often rebooting the device or terminal fixes issues."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "h3",
        "text": "Bootstrap failed: 5: Input/output error",
        "id": "Bootstrap-failed-5"
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "text": "Appears after `brew services start postgresql`."
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "text": "Fix: run `launchctl remove homebrew.mxcl.postgresql` then `brew services start postgresql`."
      },

      {
        "type": "h2",
        "text": "Commands",
        "id": "Commands"
      },
      {
        "type": "note",
        "kind": "info",
        "title": "Authorization",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "p",
            "text": "Commands are entered in `psql` as an authorized user."
          }
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "h3",
        "text": "Authorization",
        "id": "Authorization"
      },
      {
        "type": "ul",
        "items": [
          "Default user: `psql postgres`",
          "Specific user: `psql postgres -U [user_name]`",
          "Exit: `\\q`"
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "h3",
        "text": "Databases",
        "id": "Databases"
      },
      {
        "type": "ul",
        "items": [
          "List DBs: `\\l`",
          "Create: `create database [name];`",
          "Drop: `drop database [name];`",
          "Rename: `alter database [old] rename to [new];`"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "text": "Import DB:"
      },
      {
        "type": "ul",
        "items": [
          "`psql -h [host] -d [db] -U [user] -f ~/path/to/file.sql`",
          "`psql [db] < ~/path/to/file.sql`"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "text": "Export DB: `pg_dump -U [user] -h [host] [db] >> export_file.sql`"
      },

      {
        "type": "h3",
        "text": "Users",
        "id": "Users"
      },
      {
        "type": "ul",
        "items": [
          "Create user with password: `create role [name] with login password 'pass';`",
          "Encrypted password: `create role [name] with login encrypted password 'pass';`",
          "Without password: `create role [name] with login;`",
          "Delete user: `drop user [name];`",
          "Rename user: `alter user [old] rename to [new];`",
          "Change password: `alter user [name] with password 'new_pass';`"
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "h3",
        "text": "Tables",
        "id": "Tables"
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "text": "Create table example:"
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "sql",
        "wide": true,
        "code": "create table accounts (\n  user_id serial PRIMARY KEY,\n  username VARCHAR(50) UNIQUE NOT NULL,\n  password VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,\n  email VARCHAR(255) UNIQUE NOT NULL,\n  created_on TIMESTAMP NOT NULL,\n  last_login TIMESTAMP\n);"
      },
      { "type": "p", "text": "Drop table: `drop table accounts;`" },

      {
        "type": "h2",
        "text": "Connecting to a database in projects",
        "id": "Connecting-to-a-database-in-projects"
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "text": "PostgreSQL runs on port 5432 by default. Connect using IP and port (e.g., localhost:5432)."
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "text": "Use ENV files to store connection details (IP, port, username, password)."
      },
      {
        "type": "ul",
        "items": [
          "Create user: `CREATE ROLE MyNewUserName WITH LOGIN PASSWORD 'MyNewUserPassword';`",
          "Grant DB creation: `ALTER ROLE MyNewUserName CREATEDB;`",
          "Login as new user: `psql postgres -U MyNewUserName`"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "note",
        "kind": "info",
        "title": "Reminder",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "p",
            "text": "Replace MyNewUserName/MyNewUserPassword with your credentials."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "data": {
    "ru": {
      "title": "Установка PostgreSQL на macOS (Apple Silicon m1/m2)",
      "anonce": "Как установить PostgreSQL на macOS (включая Apple Silicon M1/M2) и подключить его к вашим приложениям.",
      "content": [
        { "type": "h2", "text": "Введение", "id": "Introduction" },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "При разработке приложений часто требуется хранить и управлять данными в базах данных. В этой статье показано, как установить PostgreSQL на macOS и подключить его к своим приложениям."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Мы рассмотрим методы установки, использование терминала, подключение из приложений и базовые команды PostgreSQL."
        },

        { "type": "h2", "text": "Установка", "id": "Installation" },
        { "type": "p", "text": "Установить PostgreSQL можно двумя способами:" },
        {
          "type": "ul",
          "items": [
            "Через установщик с официального сайта",
            "С помощью пакетного менеджера Homebrew (рекомендуется)"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Оба способа позволяют полноценно установить PostgreSQL на систему."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "kind": "info",
          "title": "Рекомендуемый способ",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "p",
              "text": "Наиболее распространённый и рекомендуемый способ установки PostgreSQL — через Homebrew."
            }
          ]
        },

        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "Через установщик",
          "id": "Through-the-installer"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "html": "Перейдите на <a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/ftp/source/\" target=\"_blank\">официальный сайт PostgreSQL</a> и скачайте нужную версию."
        },
        {
          "type": "ul",
          "items": [
            "Выберите нужную версию (например, v14.2) и откройте каталог",
            "Скачайте <strong>postgresql-[версия].tar.gz</strong>",
            "Распакуйте и откройте папку",
            "Проверьте файл INSTALL для пошаговой инструкции",
            "Следуйте инструкциям в терминале для установки"
          ]
        },

        { "type": "h3", "text": "Через Homebrew", "id": "Through-Homebrew" },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Перед установкой проверьте и обновите Homebrew:"
        },
        {
          "type": "ul",
          "items": [
            "Обновить пакеты: `brew update`",
            "Обновить сам Homebrew: `brew upgrade`",
            "Исправить ошибки: `brew doctor`"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "kind": "info",
          "title": "Подробнее",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "p",
              "html": "См. руководство: <a href=\"https://amaryfilo.com/blog/how-install-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">Как установить Homebrew</a>."
            }
          ]
        },
        { "type": "p", "text": "Шаги установки PostgreSQL через Homebrew:" },
        {
          "type": "ul",
          "items": [
            "`brew install postgresql`",
            "`brew services start postgresql` (запуск сервиса)",
            "`brew services stop postgresql` (остановка сервиса)",
            "`brew services list` (проверка статуса)",
            "Вход: `psql postgres`",
            "Список пользователей: `\\du`",
            "Выход: `\\q`"
          ]
        },

        { "type": "h3", "text": "Дополнительно", "id": "Extras" },
        {
          "type": "ul",
          "items": [
            "Ручной запуск: `/opt/homebrew/opt/postgresql/bin/postgres -D /opt/homebrew/var/postgres`",
            "Запуск/остановка через pg_ctl: `pg_ctl -D /opt/homebrew/var/postgres start|stop`"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "kind": "info",
          "title": "Удаление",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "p",
